This directory is the canonical source for repository agent skills.

The skill definitions under `.agents/skills/` are used by Codex in this
repository, and their correspondence with `pod/perlagentskills.pod` is
validated by `t/porting/perlagentskills.t`.
The skill tree is documented in `pod/perlagentskills.pod`.
Root `AGENTS.md` contains repository-wide agent directives, and root
`CLAUDE.md` points Claude at `AGENTS.md` and this canonical skill tree.

In short:

- Edit `.agents/skills/...` first.
- Keep `pod/perlagentskills.pod` in sync with the skill directories.
- Run `./perl -I. -Ilib t/porting/perlagentskills.t` after skill edits.
